edge_image_x = conv2(double(smoothed_image), sobel_x, 'same');

% Apply Sobel operator in y direction
edge_image_y = conv2(double(smoothed_image), sobel_y, 'same');

% Combine edges in both directions
edge_image = sqrt(edge_image_x.^2 + edge_image_y.^2);

% Display edge image
imshow(edge_image);
```

This modified code applies a Gaussian filter using the `fspecial` function with a specified standard deviation before applying the Sobel edge detection. The resulting edges will be smoother and less noisy compared to the original implementation.

